    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This room...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take a look, Dagda, this is our old home!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oooh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "text": "Must've been pretty good, living here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No shit it was!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hannah never did the cleaning, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oi, Vina! How many more times do you want me to fess up to my mistakes?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I dropped in now and then after you left, tidied things a little. Been a few years, but shouldn't be much different than it was?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cardboard",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "My whole stash is still here! Always knew you were tight, Baird!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* Fancy me having to be the poor girl left behind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't give me that, Baird. You told us you were going to stay!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "text": "How you need to be in your own bed, be shambling the moment you were out of Norport!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, well, maybe I should've tried and put up with it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stuff that! You think I don't know you? We're all stuck in hell when you can't sleep!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I'm tired enough to go six feet under, the last thing I want is you trying to chinwag with me again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahah, well, I've been falling asleep just about anywhere these days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What, too tired?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Might be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just, found out sleeping's the... best way to empty your head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Once my Rhodes Island mission's done, Baird, I'll bring you lot out of here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "All of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, here, here, let's pop some bottles to celebrate getting back together after all these years!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's cheap stuff, but hey, maybe leaving it so long made it better?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "text": "Morgan, give Baird a read of those books you wrote! Tell her about our adventures!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Baird, you're missing your chance to become part of the King's chronicles\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Morgan? What's wrong? You've been pale as a sheet this whole time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We finally made it home! You ought to chin up a little.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm thinking about... the... hand I stepped on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was probably just some accident.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It had a thumb ring on it. Something's telling me I've seen it somewhere before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "text": "I feel like I should remember...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I just keep drawing a blank.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... Baird, what's been happening in Norport all these days?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not much, Morgan. Maybe it <i>was</i> just an accident.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone's been trying their hardest to survive, that's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's in the past, anyway. You're back now. We'll be out of here soon. That's enough for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Norport's our home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I used to picture what it'd be like when we came back. I thought we'd spend our first night piling into that snooker place to play until the sun came up, then go drinking next door until it all went dark.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or maybe we'd go to McClaren at the video place and reserve all the seats, end up watching ten whole adventure movies back to back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I saw it. But I didn't dare look properly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "text": "All that broken glass caked with the blood, and the... shadows all on the ground inside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should get a proper kip. Like me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "text": "Must be shattered after coming all this way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Vina, you've got that Realmblade now. You'll be the hero, yeah?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll save Norport. We'll save Norport.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This'll all just pass, right?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll take back our old lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe if...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nah. Look how late it is. Get some rest, muckers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've got mountains to deal with tomorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Baird's right, Morgan. We all need to... get some proper rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
