    {
        "text": "*huff*\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haven't gotten any taller, mm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, we're adults. We stopped growing ages ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You never know with these things. I remember when we first met, you were only about this tall...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough, enough. It's the same old guff you always spout about time passing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I haven't had anyone in years to tell that same old guff to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Baird.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just glad you're back, Your Majesty Vina.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't call me that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "text": "King of the Siege, same as ever, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
