    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_869_1#9$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_869_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it, Lady Ermengarde?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_869_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't call me Lady. I'm not that old yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ermengarde"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry... um, Miss Ermengarde? I'm not quite sure how old you liches are...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_869_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* Forget it. Lady Ermengarde will do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ermengarde"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_869_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This high-speed battleship really has been reduced to tatters. Grr. And the Vampire's cohort gave this place a bathing too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ermengarde"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "General Manfred says this is going to be the start of the Sarkaz's victory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_869_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hrmph. The Sarkaz's victory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ermengarde"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_869_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* And old Dame Kal'tsit kept warning me a future like this wouldn't bring anything about for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ermengarde"
    },
    {
        "text": "Still, I just can't figure it out. Why would my tutor have had a Feline friend for so long?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ermengarde"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_869_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're leaving. I hate the stench of this place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ermengarde"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come with me, please. Her Highness Theresa is waiting for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
