    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#16$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, good morning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#21$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need to make some plans... for our upcoming operation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#19$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sarkaz are treating the citizens as insurance that they won't be directly artillery-struck, but whether the Military Commission or the dukes, we can't truly count on their benevolence in this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And even if we ignore the game that's ongoing between them, we're still bearing witness to the terrible state the blockade zone is in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've seen the state of chaos Norport is in these days. Far easier said than done to change the status quo.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That medicine and stuff you brought with... I gave it a count. Afraid it's only a drop in the bucket.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, what you can accomplish is going to be very limited with our help alone. But that's no reason for us to hold back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#19$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Investigation of the airship and evacuation plans for the plate's citizens are simultaneous work for us. We can't afford to overlook anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#21$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the matter, Miss Delphine?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You lot have the chops, right? You wriggled through the Sarkaz blockade to get here, so I'm guessing it's as easy for you to slip back out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can say with pride that those gathered here now are all extraordinary operators of Rhodes Island, but I'm very sorry, Miss Delphine... I think we may not live up to what you're imagining.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "When pitted against those steering the war from behind the scenes, we may very well be called puny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... you only got here thanks to some help?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfortunately, it's a 'deal' as the man loved to put it, and not a fantastic one at that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you... a Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't think a duke would've found another Sarkaz lot to work with instead...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. Someone thinks too much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I just read the papers usually.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very good habit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're still planning the evac right now, aren't you? Did your fancy-pants backer agree to help?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sadly for you, no. All signs say she doesn't care.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you lot obviously do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. Welcome to Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm keeping my opinions to myself, though. My concern is whether we can get out of here alive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I've a proposal. Rhodes Islanders, this may be a bit of a risk...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sarkaz have locked down every information channel out of Norport, and I think I can guess what their excuse to the wider public is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "text": "And see, I trust any of the dukes to know it <i>is</i> nothing more than an excuse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But they won't spoil the facade themselves. In fact, the dukes and the Military Commission of Kazdel have a quiet understanding on that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, the Sarkaz are using this plate's people as an excuse. Aren't the dukes? My guess is if the Sarkaz did slaughter every last soul here, a few dukes would be breathing a sigh of relief.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "In a war, some only see ethics as a burden.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, you're not wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So we... go and break that silent understanding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need to give some of the dukes a push. Make them act more decisively.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before we're all dead here for real.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
