    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Days it's been, Golding, and still not a word from you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not this reticent a person, as far as we know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "How are the Londinium Citizens' Self-Salvation Corps?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "They've left the city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "How many of them are left?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not many, I wager.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine, back to your silence. Does it bring you any peace?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm simply... remembering them. Remembering them all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough, enough, Golding. You don't belong to them by nature, and you're free in any case to forget that insubstantial sense of affiliation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "It wasn't your hands that killed them. Most simply do just die in war. You even came up with a word for it\u2014'sacrifice.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "And most of those names, the people hiding behind them, you've never so much as met.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does becoming a member of a collective instill joy or pride in you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Regretfully, as you've seen, we can only belong to ourselves in the end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. I used to believe that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "At first, I believed I fought for our shared dream, for the Self-Salvation Corps' cause.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "In these past days, I've realized that might not have been the case.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lettou was right. We are all the same kind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "I told him he was pessimistic... yet look at me. Whether I admit it or not... I'm someone who despairs easily myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Corps' members may fight with pure ideals in heart, but the Corps itself does not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take Clovisia, or Allerdale... both women I respect for their character, yet their aims extend far beyond what they claim out loud.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "For a very long time, I pretended to be blind to that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It disillusions you now. You finally realize your undertakings were marred since the start.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "You feel your efforts were all in vain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hardly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "You see, I don't have any cause on my mind. I'm just thinking of the people. Faces upon faces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heidi, Feist, Rockrock, old Bill, Adams, little George...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no standing, and no right to say I should repent for the Self-Salvation Corps. I don't belong to any illusory collectives of that sort.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I need... to come face-to-face with every one of them, inside myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
